# Docs (`@nucleify/docs`)

Astro documentation app.

## Conventions

- Markdown content: `docs/content/{lang}/{category}/{slug}.md`
- Helpers/utils: `docs/src/lib/`
- Categories defined in `docs/src/lib/constants/docs.ts`
- Overrides: `overrides/docs/`
- Rules: `docs/.config/rules/`
- Agents: `web/.cursor/agents/`

## Commands

```bash
pnpm docs   # pnpm --filter @nucleify/docs dev
```
